Package: PhytoQuant
Type: Package
Title: Integrated Directional Gene-Signature Discovery for Plant Transcriptomes
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Dingkang", "Zhao", email = "dingkang.25@intl.zju.edu.cn",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An integrated framework for multi-cohort differential expression
    analysis and directional gene-signature construction in plant
    transcriptomics. PhytoQuant combines DESeq2, edgeR, and limma with
    robust rank aggregation, knowledge-guided refinement, and
    Sorensen-Dice-based redundancy resolution to discover compact
    activation and inhibition gene sets.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: 
    R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports: 
    DESeq2,
    edgeR,
    limma,
    RobustRankAggreg
